Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:10.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:04.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望我们继续他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的刀能杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of blade can kill a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的话 我会说没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I'd have said there was no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,打不死恶魔的 如果那是你的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't stop a demon if that's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点疼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This smarts a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要不要我帮你修枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to help you out with that gun or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一发现这个露比是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second you find out this Ruby chick is a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该去拿圣水 不是跟她闲聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go for the holy water. You don't chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没闲聊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was chatting, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.69,0:00:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那你怎么没把她送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Then why didn't you send her ass back to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me she could help you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道你的弱点是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows what your weakness is. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我弟弟是不是有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think something's wrong with my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔都撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 迪恩还是要下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I checked, Dean's still going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事急不得 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in its own time, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得做一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有违你温柔天性的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that go against that gentle nature of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的一面是\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the bright side…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会陪伴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肩膀上的小堕落天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little fallen angel on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个派对简直太烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just a terrible, terrible party.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但倒是有个特别美丽的女人在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was this one really beautiful woman there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该跟她回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've gone home with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是跟她回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱里有瓶89年的红酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bottle of '89 in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my teeth…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是那么害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了她 我完全无力阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help, I couldn't do anything to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟警方谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've talked to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟法医也谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've talked to the medical examiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都无法解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one can explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才联系了我们 达顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why they put the call in to us, Mr. Dutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但疾控中心 那是疾病控制吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the CDC, that's disease control, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么想 是病毒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, it's some kinda virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能排除任何可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not ruling out anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,达顿先生 珍妮特有敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dutton, did Janet have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人有理由想伤害她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone that might have a reason to hurt her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.73,0:04:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 有人给她下毒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying? That somebody poisoned her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说 我们得考虑到一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying we have to cover every base here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是什么样的毒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, what kind of poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是什么人做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think a person could've done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人想这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would anyone want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one that could have…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,达顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dutton?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都爱珍妮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone loved Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该不缺什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get out of your way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉不觉得那人有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dude seemed a little evasive to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我在水池下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I was under a sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,找这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulling this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hex bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恶心 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gross. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有鸟骨 兔牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are bird bones, rabbit's teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块布应该是从珍妮特·达顿的衣服上剪下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cloth is probably cut from something Janet Dutton owned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是女巫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're thinking witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 而且不是新世纪巫士占卜什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and not some New Age Wiccan water dowser either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是古老的黑魔法 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Old World black magic, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,满脸疖子那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, warts and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是把自己的体液吐的到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always spewing their bodily fluids everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 差不多吧 - 真瘆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pretty much. - It's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且极其不卫生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's downright unsanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对有人仇视珍妮特·达顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone definitely had it out for Janet Dutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那人溜了进去 放了巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, someone who snuck into that house and planted the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是住在树林里 满脸皱纹的布莱尔女巫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're looking for some craggy old Blair Bitch in the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 可能是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Could be anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,邻居 同事 男人 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighbor, coworker, man, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟其他人一样 也是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're human like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那我们怎么找到那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. How we gonna find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是随机案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't random.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特·达顿生活中有一个跟她有仇的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone in Janet Dutton's life had an ugly ax to grind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到动机 - 就能找到杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We find the motive… - We find the murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:05:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我心事太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I've got like a thousand things on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚没来参加读书俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't come to book club last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 抱歉 我本想打电话的 但我太忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sorry. I was gonna call. I just… I got busy. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没事 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm fine. Really,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没事 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这顿晚餐是给你准备的 保罗·亚瑟·达顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dinner was cooked for you, Paul Arthur Dutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要吃下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're going to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,查看车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是遇上什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人杀了你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone murdered your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还想杀你 就是这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they're trying to kill you. That's what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能 不会的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible. There's no way…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 要不是我们跟踪了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, if we hadn't been following you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这会儿就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be a doornail right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who wants you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 有个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 我出轨了 那是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - An affair. A mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心态不平衡 还勒索我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was unbalanced, she was blackmailing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一周前跟她结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I put an end to it a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她能跟这有什么关系… - 保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What could she have to do with…? - Paul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a curve ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个手腕三道 垂直划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three per wrist, vertical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不是闹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她施的魔法很邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like she was working some heavyweight evil here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的女巫 真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigging witches. Seriously, man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们知道那颗兔牙哪来的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we know where she got the rabbit's teeth from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗真是会挑人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Paul sure knows how to pick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.05,Title,0,0,0,0,,简直像《致命诱惑》重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like Fatal Attraction all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且怎么每次都有兔子被害惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why does a rabbit always gets screwed on the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我哪里不明白吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I don't get, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她一心要复仇 为什么自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she was so bent on revenge, why do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.65,0:11:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀了珍妮特·达顿 以为保罗也被她干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she got Janet Dutton, thought she'd finished off Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,便决定自杀 算是被弃情人的帽子戏法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decided to cap herself, make it a spurned lover's hat trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看上去不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this doesn't exactly look like a.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个阳光稳定的人的客厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}TV room of a bright and stable person, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:11:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是巫术袋 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another hex bag? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是刺杀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we got a hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫黑吃黑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little witch-on-witch violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一具尸体 梅菲尔区309号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to report a dead body. 309 Mayfair Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字吗 嗯 我叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name? Yeah, sure. My name is…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫为什么要相互残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are witches ganking each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可能遇到了女巫团\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think maybe we got a coven on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没被你们的读书俱乐部蒙蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fooled by your little book club, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们这些女人等我走后都做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you ladies get up to when I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是扯闲篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all dish and gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们上次有人带书来是什么时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when's the last time anyone actually brought a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 罗恩 - 晚安 罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, Ron. - Good night, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Amanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那是读书俱乐部的事 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's book-club business, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 塔米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Tammi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方刚抬走她的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police just took away her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我们就假装那事没发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what? We're just gonna pretend it didn't happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱阿曼达的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We loved Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们知道她有点不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we know that she was a little, well, unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这也是真的 - 而且我们得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Also true. - And we have to face it…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,八成是她杀了珍妮特·达顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}she probably killed Janet Dutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人不会突然就把牙吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People just don't spit out their teeth all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得中止读书俱乐部 这太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop book club. This has all gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth, just take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:14:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但都死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达自杀了 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda killed herself, yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她还杀了珍妮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, yes, she killed Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful, awful business, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想读书俱乐部为我们带来了什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And think about what book club has gotten us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丈夫的升职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband's promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢得的夏威夷之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little trip to Hawaii that you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.77,0:14:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的自制陶器生意总算有起色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My home pottery business is finally taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却想停下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wanna just stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想停下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩去打梦幻橄榄球了 一小时后就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron gets back from his fantasy football in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:53.71,Title,0,0,0,0,,《暗影之书》 我们跪在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Book of Shadows, we kneel before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们侍奉你的主人 你也服务我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us serve your master as you serve us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:15:00.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,《暗影之书》 我们跪在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Book of Shadows, we kneel before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们侍奉你的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us serve your master…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定很擅长园艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have a green thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让这些草药反季生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting these herbs to grow out of season like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.03,0:15:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我该先自我介绍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I should have introduced myself first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 巴克曼警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, Detective Bachman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是特纳警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Detective Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在跟进阿曼达·伯恩斯的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're following up on Amanda Burns' death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街区里到处转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going around the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找邻居们聊聊什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}talking to her neighbors and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But didn't she…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是自杀的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she killed herself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.17,0:15:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说你跟死者是朋友 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard you were friends with the deceased. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她施法的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea about her practices?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What kinda practices?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她家里有各种撒旦崇拜的器具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see, her house was littered with satanic paraphernalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是黑色安息日\N{\fnArial\fs30}A regular black Sabbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可是新教圣公会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she was an Episcopalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:54.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,那她肯定是用错了《圣经》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we're pretty sure she was using the wrong Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮 这两位是警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renee, these are detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说阿曼达…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say Amanda was…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在施法… - 抱歉 警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was practicing… - Sorry, detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能看得出 伊丽莎白有些难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell that Elizabeth is a little upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 这位是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Miss…?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮·范·艾伦太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Renee Van Allen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.84,0:16:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我给你拼出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to spell it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能行 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get by, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达的事 让丽莎很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Amanda business has been hard for Liz,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你自以为了解一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, you think you know a person…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们都有秘密 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we all have secrets, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个伊丽莎白绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm already sold on that Elizabeth chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到她的胜利花园了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that victory garden of hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,颠茄 附子草 曼德拉草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belladonna, wolf's bane, mandrake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提我们提到法术时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention that flinch she threw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她躲闪的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we mentioned the occult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她近来绝对是顺风顺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's definitely had a good run lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳税等级提升了不少 赢了太多彩票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone up a few tax brackets, won almost too many raffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那种黑魔法能换来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind of thing a little black magic always helps with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我觉得不止她一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she's alone either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来蕾妮·范·艾伦太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Mrs. Renee Van Allen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这三个月来赢了几乎所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}has won almost every craft contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她参加的手工艺品大赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's entered in the past three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,家政女王吗 除了魔鬼崇拜的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}A regular Martha Stewart, huh? Except for the devil worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们刚刚见到的就是女巫团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking that was the coven we met back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是少了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}minus one member.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达显然是出了安全区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda was clearly going off the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 她们为保持表象而杀了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, they killed her to keep up appearances?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们看上去像群很看重表象的人 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like an appearance kind of crowd. Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她们杀了个疯子 我们该感谢她们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they killed a nutjob, should we, uh, thank them or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们也在施黑魔法 迪恩 得阻止她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're working black magic too, Dean. They need to be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「阻止」她们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stopped like "stopped"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是人 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're humans, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:17:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死吧 女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn, witch, burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 听我说 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, listen to me, there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.01,0:18:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've to get out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是露比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Ruby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 未曾有幸呢 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never had the pleasure. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就希望你会再出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd show up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那玩意对着别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point that thing somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.39,0:18:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车离开 别回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car. And don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.73,0:18:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收拾得了几个小女巫 谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take care of a few kitchen witches. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是说那几个女巫 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about witches, you jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫只是婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches are whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指她们侍奉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about who they serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她们的法力来自恶魔 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They get their power from demons. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里现在就有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's one here. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 除了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you mean besides you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 它知道你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it knows you're in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会来追杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gonna come after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对应付不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's way more than you can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. What is this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你不会真听信她的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you're not listening to this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,管好你哥哥 萨姆 如果你想保住他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a leash on your brother, Sam, if you wanna keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, just chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在扰乱你的心绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's messing with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道为什么 他们就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows why. That's who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还叫你闭嘴呢 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm telling you to shut up, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你凭什么掺和这段对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, why are you even a part of this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许因为他是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe because he's my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个黑眼骚货\N{\fnArial\fs30}you black-eyed skank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你那么在乎你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right. You care about your brother so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你几个月后要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're checking out in a few month,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下他一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving him all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 至少让我努力救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - At least let me try and save him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你今后不能再这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you won't be here to do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫你闭嘴 - 迪恩 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said, shut up! - Dean, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个恶魔 萨姆 就这么简单 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam. Period. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要我们死 我们想要他们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us dead, we want them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思 我还记得俄亥俄州的那个恶魔女\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny, I remember that demon chick in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.28,0:20:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯茜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casey?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不希望我杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want her dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她可没像钓鱼一样钓着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, she wasn't stringing me along like a fish on a hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人在钓着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's stringing me along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是危险的 她是危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it's dangerous, that she is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管怎样 她对我们有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like it or not, she's useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们要在她杀了我们前杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We kill her before she kills us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什么杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮我们修好的枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun she fixed for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,能成功就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 如果她希望我们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if she wants us dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只需要不再救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}all she has to do is stop saving our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得开始看到大局 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we have to start looking at the big picture, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始考虑策略 提前做打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start thinking in strategies and moves ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么简单了 我们不仅仅是在猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not so simple. We're not just hunting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么总问我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you always asking me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为首先 你在听一个恶魔的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're taking advice from a demon, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你似乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way, you seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越不在意杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}less and less worried about offing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前你很为此不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it used to eat you up inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对我又有什么好处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And what has that gotten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但你就该是那样的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. But it's just what you're supposed to do. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该开着车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to drive in the frigging car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这种事吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}and frigging argue about this stuff, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你念叨着什么生命可贵什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on about the sanctity of life and all that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在气我开始认同你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So you're mad because I'm starting to agree with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not mad. I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.05,0:21:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是担心 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心你 因为你不像自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried, because you're not acting like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我是不像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You're right. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你要走了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, you're leaving, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得留在这个破烂的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I gotta stay here in this craphole of a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以依我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the way I see it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想活下来 如果我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm gonna make it, if I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你走后打好这场仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}fight this war after you're gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我得改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I gotta change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变成什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change into what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得更像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta be more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:21:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.35,0:22:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 不对劲 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, something's wrong. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体里像有一堆刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of knives inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女巫团 肯定是她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coven, man. It's gotta be the coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.19,0:22:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了谁 你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let who go? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你知道我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you know about me…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.35,0:23:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道这把枪的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you know about this gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.60,0:23:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要害死我哥哥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.31,0:23:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他 远离祭坛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let him go. Get away from the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.27,0:23:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.78,0:23:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,排队吧 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in line, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:24:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再喊我贱人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop calling me bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.47,0:24:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.35,0:24:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我们没伤害谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We weren't hurting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我们都不认识你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. We don't even know your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.77,0:24:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止咒语 否则受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the spell. Or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.31,0:24:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五秒 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five seconds. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.36,0:24:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四秒 - 不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four. - No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:24:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.94,0:24:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在帮蕾妮降低按揭利率\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just getting Renee a lower mortgage rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.49,0:24:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你再拿那把枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you point that gun at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.87,0:24:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会只是消失那么简单了 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna just disappear. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.46,0:24:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.63,0:24:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it was ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.67,0:24:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道像屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tasted like ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.51,0:24:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫巫术 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called witchcraft, short bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才蠢蛋呢 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the short bus, short bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.02,0:24:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Maybe it's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.27,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.07,0:25:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.41,0:25:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what he's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.12,0:25:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.70,0:25:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人 你们女巫团的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, all of you, everyone in your little coven,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.62,0:25:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,都遇上了好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've all had runs of good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.62,0:25:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能上报的好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newsworthy good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你 塔米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for you, Tammi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.34,0:25:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell me, why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.63,0:25:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己不想要点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want anything for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.51,0:25:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是因为你已经得到了你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it because you're already getting what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.88,0:25:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如她们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like these women's souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.89,0:25:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…我没…我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm not… I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.48,0:25:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺聪明 大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice dick work, Magnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.73,0:25:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.28,0:25:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.24,0:25:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.15,0:25:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 找不到我的巫术袋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Couldn't find my hex bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.53,0:25:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.83,0:25:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你哥哥的肺这会儿应该都咳在地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your brother's lungs should be in the floor by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.26,0:26:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你麻烦大了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a lot of trouble, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔米 你的眼睛怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tammi, what's wrong with your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.44,0:26:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔米 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tammi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.94,0:26:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮 闭上你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renee, shut your painted hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.29,0:26:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想在我家耍威风 塔米·班顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in my house, Tammi Benton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.50,0:26:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你抓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the girl go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait your turn, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.90,0:26:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.72,0:26:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.01,0:26:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.60,0:26:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是塔米\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Tammi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.18,0:26:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我在用她的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I'm wearing her meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:26:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得想办法跟你们套近乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to break the ice with you girls somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.81,0:27:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了蕾妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Renee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.73,0:27:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renee, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.03,0:27:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,被淘汰的女巫就是这下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happens to witches who get voted off the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.99,0:27:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.07,0:27:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说来有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny story, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.54,0:27:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得那些你向他们祈祷的黑暗恶魔力量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember all those dark, demonic forces you prayed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.16,0:27:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓侍奉的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you swore your servitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.29,0:27:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在向谁祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just who did you think you were praying to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.38,0:27:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… This isn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.38,0:27:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.55,0:27:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.30,0:27:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make-believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,积极思维吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.51,0:27:32.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,《秘密》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.05,0:27:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.97,0:27:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.47,0:27:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把自己卖给了我 蠢猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold yourself to me, you pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.44,0:27:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要带一本好书来读书俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I had to do was bring one good book to book club…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.31,0:27:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个女人就排着队拍我马屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you ladies lined up to kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.07,0:27:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.03,0:27:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.63,0:27:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did. You knew every step of the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.03,0:27:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你的永恒灵魂属于我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now your ever-living souls are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.12,0:28:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有评论吗 有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comments? Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.75,0:28:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到了我们的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here in our little town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.38,0:28:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.72,0:28:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的朋友们在找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}my friends and I, we've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.26,0:28:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.45,0:28:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 因为我要带领什么破恶魔大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, because I'm supposed to lead some piss-poor demon army.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.31,0:28:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 完全不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.39,0:28:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们的弥赛亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not our messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.27,0:28:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.69,0:28:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是西方崛起了新领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a new leader rising in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.28,0:28:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是该压的马 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the horse to bet on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是会撕碎这世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who's gonna tear this world apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.99,0:28:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, this demon…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.79,0:28:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不怎么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}he doesn't like you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.79,0:28:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢有竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't want the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.72,0:28:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是针对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.47,0:28:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了公关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a PR thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.03,0:29:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,买一送一 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two for one. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.42,0:29:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.96,0:29:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.26,0:29:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}came to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冲出了魔鬼之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it out of the Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.05,0:29:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是场大战 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a bitch of a fight, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.81,0:29:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之门可不会开多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors out of hell only open for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.14,0:29:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么 露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.77,0:29:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你我好迷失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been lost without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新收留我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才把温家兄弟引了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I led the Winchesters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.63,0:29:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了吧 - 他们是献给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you so. - They're for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.99,0:30:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.29,0:30:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我重新侍奉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me serve you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.33,0:30:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.54,0:30:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wanted you…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.46,0:30:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.05,0:30:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是我的骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were one of my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.97,0:30:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但话说回来 你一直是个撒谎婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then again, you always were a lying whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把注压在这俩谐星身上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you threw in your chips with Abbott and Costello here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.16,0:31:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.33,0:31:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刻似曾相识啊 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here before, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.01,0:31:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没告诉你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.77,0:31:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概太丢脸了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty mortifying, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.06,0:31:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我很久很久以前转化了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned her out a long, long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.61,0:31:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 她曾是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, here, was a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.19,0:31:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你那时还是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course that was when you were human.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.87,0:32:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想你朋友知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't want your friends to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多个世纪前 你把自己卖给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all those centuries back you sold yourself to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.54,0:32:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embarrassing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.21,0:32:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去的地方没有秘密 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No secrets where you're heading, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.31,0:33:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.44,0:34:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会收拾这烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.03,0:34:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.62,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.56,0:35:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来魔鬼可能真在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the devil may care after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要我相信这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I'm supposed to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.15,0:35:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.94,0:35:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wacky night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.57,0:35:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.91,0:35:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were human once.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.95,0:35:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 下了地狱 便成了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You died, you went to hell, and became a…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.12,0:35:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.71,0:35:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.25,0:35:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大瘟疫时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when the plague was big.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.34,0:35:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 每个可恶的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all of them, every damn demon…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.51,0:35:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都曾是人类吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were all human once?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.81,0:35:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个我见过的都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.60,0:36:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们的样子可不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they sure don't act like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.35,0:36:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大部分已忘记了那是什么滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them have forgotten what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.98,0:36:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至忘了他们曾是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or even that they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.57,0:36:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是下地狱后会发生的事 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happens when you go to hell, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是地狱的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what hell is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.86,0:36:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgetting what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.57,0:36:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔给我上哲学课 免了吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A philosophy lesson from a demon. I'll pass, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.08,0:36:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是哲学\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.45,0:36:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是隐喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.67,0:36:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,深渊里是真有烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a real fire in the pit…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.21,0:36:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想象的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agonies you can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.59,0:36:28.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,不 我看过《猛鬼追魂》 知道个大概\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I saw Hellraiser. I get the gist.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.17,0:36:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 他们描述得还挺准确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, they got that pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就除了各种定制皮具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for all the custom leather.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.73,0:36:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 答案是「是」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.65,0:36:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.94,0:36:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.07,0:36:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会遭遇一样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same thing will happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.19,0:36:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会要几个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might take centuries but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.65,0:36:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但迟早 地狱会烧光你的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}sooner or later, hell will burn away your humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.87,0:36:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个要下地狱的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hell-bound soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.08,0:37:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个都会变成别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}every one turns into something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.58,0:37:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns you into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.37,0:37:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.21,0:37:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you can count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.05,0:37:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没办法让我不下地狱 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way of saving me from the pit, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.18,0:37:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.94,0:37:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么告诉萨姆有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you tell Sam that you could?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.23,0:37:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让他跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he would talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.15,0:37:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们温家人很偏执\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Winchesters can be pretty bigoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.74,0:37:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要个借口 让他忘记…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed something to help him get past the whole…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.33,0:37:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很难忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty hard to get past.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.08,0:37:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼命装不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to be all stoic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.88,0:37:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真让人心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, it's heartbreaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么告诉我这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.84,0:37:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.88,0:37:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮什么 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help with what? - With Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.64,0:38:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚捅死那恶魔的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you stuck that demon tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.60,0:38:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.60,0:38:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆快达到那水平了 但还差点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's almost there but not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.90,0:38:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要帮我为他做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to help me get him ready…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.11,0:38:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎接没有你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}for life without you…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.90,0:38:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自扛起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight this war on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.78,0:38:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.87,0:38:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么希望我们赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want us to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.63,0:38:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不明显吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.47,0:38:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.18,0:38:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望我跟他们一样 但我不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I was, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.68,0:38:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.85,0:38:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What what's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.94,0:38:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,做人的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being human.
